  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen hovering on a World in VRCat's Variety Box the Tooltip at the bottom of the Menu will display the worlds description. This is not the case in all the other Categories of the Worlds Tab.\n# Suggestion:\nAlso show the Worlds Description on hover in all of the other Categories of the Worlds Tab in the Main Menu. This would make it more consistent and would help with quickly getting info about a world.\n# Attachments:\nIn the first picture you can see the Tooltip in VRCat's Variety Box and in the second one the Tooltip in other Categories:",
